cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Fisheye-to-Cubemap"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Heath
    given-names: Mike
    alias: LaunchedPix
  - family-names: Gee
    given-names: Alex
    alias: Macgregor
date-released: 2026-04-28
version: "4.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Convert calibrated fisheye and unstitched 360-camera images into 5 pinhole cube
  faces for Structure-from-Motion alignment, en route to 3D Gaussian Splatting
  reconstruction. Reads Agisoft Metashape lens calibration, reprojects each
  fisheye pixel to a ray direction, and remaps to cube faces suitable for
  pinhole-only alignment workflows.
keywords:
  - fisheye
  - 360 camera
  - cubemap
  - photogrammetry
  - structure from motion
  - gaussian splatting
  - 3DGS
  - Agisoft Metashape
